sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Server as Regex Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Dispatcher as Pattern Dispatcher
    participant Builtin as Built-in Detectors<br/>(email, SSN, credit-card)
    participant Custom as Custom Regex Engine

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Flow 1: Text Content Detection (PII Scanning)

    Orchestrator->>Server: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>No Auth (plaintext HTTP)
    Note right of Orchestrator: Request body:<br/>{ "contents": ["text..."],<br/>  "detector_params": {<br/>    "regex": ["email", "ssn",<br/>     "custom-pattern"] } }

    Server->>Dispatcher: Parse request & dispatch patterns

    loop For each pattern name
        alt Built-in pattern (email, ssn, credit-card)
            Dispatcher->>Builtin: Match built-in regex
            Builtin-->>Dispatcher: Match results (positions, types, scores)
        else Custom regex pattern
            Dispatcher->>Custom: Compile & match custom regex
            Custom-->>Dispatcher: Match results (positions, types, scores)
        end
    end

    Dispatcher-->>Server: Aggregated detection results

    Server-->>Orchestrator: HTTP 200 OK<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    Note left of Server: Response body:<br/>[ { "start": 5, "end": 25,<br/>    "detection_type": "email",<br/>    "detection": "user@example.com",<br/>    "score": 1.0 } ]

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Flow 2: Health Check

    Orchestrator->>Server: GET /health<br/>No Auth
    Server-->>Orchestrator: HTTP 200 OK<br/>"healthy"
